      "writtenOn": "2017-03-28T18:41:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if we could use another name here. Perhaps isCellularTetheringAllowed? carrierAllowsCellularTethering?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2197,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 2197,
